sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant ConsoleMenu
    participant BookingService
    participant Show
    participant ShowSeat
    participant PriceCalculator
    participant TicketPrinter

    Customer->>+ConsoleMenu: choose show, A1, and UPI
    create participant Payment as UpiPayment
    ConsoleMenu->>+Payment: <<create>> UpiPayment(true)
    Payment-->>-ConsoleMenu: payment object
    ConsoleMenu->>+BookingService: bookSeats(show, [A1], customer, payment)
    BookingService->>+Show: findShowSeat("A1")
    Show-->>-BookingService: showSeat
    BookingService->>+ShowSeat: isAvailable()
    ShowSeat-->>-BookingService: true
    BookingService->>+PriceCalculator: calculate([showSeat])
    PriceCalculator-->>-BookingService: 150.00

    create participant Booking
    BookingService->>+Booking: <<create>> Booking(show, customer, [A1], 150)
    Booking-->>-BookingService: booking BK1001 (PENDING)
    BookingService->>+ShowSeat: bookSeat()
    ShowSeat-->>-BookingService: true

    BookingService->>+Payment: pay(150.00)
    Payment-->>-BookingService: true
    BookingService->>+Booking: confirm("UPI")
    Booking-->>-BookingService: status = CONFIRMED
    BookingService->>+TicketPrinter: print(booking)
    TicketPrinter-->>-BookingService: ticket printed
    BookingService-->>-ConsoleMenu: confirmed booking + ticket
    ConsoleMenu-->>-Customer: display confirmation and ticket

    Note over BookingService,ShowSeat: If pay() returns false, releaseSeat() is called,<br/>Booking becomes FAILED, and no ticket is printed.
